WEBVTT

00:09.426 --> 00:10.760
[Gotak] Hey, Jun-tae, look here.

00:10.844 --> 00:14.264
All fights are about
dominating the opponent. Okay?

00:14.764 --> 00:17.475
Kicking up your leg, hah, just like I do,

00:17.559 --> 00:19.477
will be enough to scare your opponent.

00:20.562 --> 00:21.813
Give it a try.

00:21.896 --> 00:22.772
Okay.

00:23.273 --> 00:24.357
Aah!

00:24.441 --> 00:25.316
Oh.

00:25.400 --> 00:26.401
Ah shit.

00:27.235 --> 00:28.236
Hey, Jun-tae-ya.

00:28.319 --> 00:30.697
What the… what the hell
is wrong with your body?

00:30.780 --> 00:32.741
- [Baku] That kid…
- [Gotak] Do you have any muscles?

00:32.824 --> 00:34.075
[Baku] That kid can't be helped.

00:34.159 --> 00:38.329
- His… coach is quite bad at teaching.
- [Gotak] You have to balance…

00:38.413 --> 00:40.331
- You should be his coach, then.
- [Baku] Nope.

00:40.415 --> 00:41.541
[Gotak] …your whole body.

00:41.624 --> 00:45.170
I decided never again,
am I ever gonna teach

00:45.253 --> 00:46.755
anybody else how to fight.

00:46.838 --> 00:50.467
[Gotak] Oh my God! Bro! Why do you keep
sticking your freaking butt out?

00:51.843 --> 00:52.927
[Baku] You know what?

00:54.345 --> 00:55.513
Gotak, that brat…

00:55.597 --> 00:57.348
[Gotak] Eye contact, and twist.

00:57.432 --> 00:59.142
…used to be a taekwondo pro.

00:59.642 --> 01:01.936
- An athlete.
- [Gotak] Yeah. Hold your legs.

01:03.396 --> 01:05.273
But he had to quit because of me.

01:08.693 --> 01:11.446
He hurt his cruciate ligament
and was hospitalized.

01:12.572 --> 01:15.950
And the doctor said
his athletic future was gone.

01:16.034 --> 01:17.452
He couldn't compete anymore.

01:19.079 --> 01:20.872
His mom cried her eyes out.

01:23.208 --> 01:24.876
I was pissed the hell off.

01:25.752 --> 01:28.755
I was thinking about killing
everyone who did that to Gotak.

01:31.800 --> 01:33.802
[poignant music playing]

01:34.344 --> 01:35.553
[Baku sighs]

01:37.847 --> 01:39.724
I only realized a lot later…

01:41.643 --> 01:43.394
what the hardest part was.

01:47.482 --> 01:50.110
It was knowing
that everything was all my fault.

01:58.451 --> 01:59.911
[clears throat]

02:00.829 --> 02:04.582
I felt… It was the worst feeling. It, um…

02:05.416 --> 02:07.627
I can't remember the word.
What was it again?

02:08.211 --> 02:10.380
- It's the guilt.
- Right, guilt.

02:15.176 --> 02:17.011
I had a friend like that too.

02:28.648 --> 02:30.650
["Hero" by Meego playing]

02:45.582 --> 02:48.418
WEAK HERO:
CLASS 2

03:47.644 --> 03:49.354
[Si-eun] Su-ho-ya.

03:51.231 --> 03:52.607
I'm sorry.

04:02.992 --> 04:04.619
- [Baku] You sleep okay?
- [sighs]

04:13.419 --> 04:15.338
You slept for, like, forever.

04:18.341 --> 04:20.927
I almost died running away,
carrying you on my back.

04:21.010 --> 04:22.428
Why are you so heavy?

04:22.512 --> 04:23.680
[Si-eun gasps]

04:24.889 --> 04:26.057
What happened?

04:26.766 --> 04:31.521
Well, Geum Seong-je was unlucky
and got caught, but we got away.

04:32.105 --> 04:33.398
So no worries.

04:36.109 --> 04:37.193
Anyway…

04:39.404 --> 04:41.030
I'm sorry, and thanks.

04:44.659 --> 04:46.703
I'll make sure this never happens again.

04:50.498 --> 04:52.208
Are you going back to fight?

04:55.962 --> 04:56.963
What?

04:57.463 --> 04:58.548
If you do…

05:02.051 --> 05:03.636
that won't change anything.

05:03.720 --> 05:05.722
[poignant music playing]

05:09.225 --> 05:12.061
[Si-eun] It's just going to be a cycle,
repeating itself.

05:16.316 --> 05:18.276
In the end, someone will get hurt.

05:26.034 --> 05:27.493
And after that?

05:35.626 --> 05:36.878
Why does…

05:38.338 --> 05:39.630
Na Baek-jin treat you like that?

05:39.714 --> 05:40.757
[child 1] Keep kicking him.

05:40.840 --> 05:42.925
- [child 2] Harder, harder.
- [child 3] Hey! Hey!

05:43.009 --> 05:44.052
You assholes!

05:44.135 --> 05:46.346
I told you not to mess with Baek-jin.
Are you okay?

05:46.429 --> 05:47.263
PARK HU-MIN

05:48.139 --> 05:49.724
Baku. [breathing shakily]

05:56.022 --> 05:57.231
[Baku] We're just…

05:59.984 --> 06:01.361
childhood friends.

06:05.490 --> 06:06.741
[sighs]

06:08.910 --> 06:13.790
NA BAEK-JIN

06:17.835 --> 06:19.921
- [ringing tone]
- [exhales]

06:26.969 --> 06:28.221
[Baek-jin] Where are you?

06:28.846 --> 06:30.556
Seong-je's at the police station.

06:33.810 --> 06:35.144
I lost, Baek-jin-a.

06:37.480 --> 06:38.481
What?

06:42.777 --> 06:44.529
This is what you wanted, isn't it?

06:47.573 --> 06:49.909
You don't care about Eunjang or whatever.

06:50.868 --> 06:52.995
You just want me to say I lost.

06:53.079 --> 06:55.248
You're the top dog, right?

06:55.331 --> 06:56.791
[melancholy music playing]

06:56.874 --> 06:58.376
[sighs]

07:01.003 --> 07:02.422
What I want…

07:08.845 --> 07:10.138
[sighs]

07:11.806 --> 07:13.015
Okay.

07:14.517 --> 07:15.643
I got it.

07:15.726 --> 07:16.769
[hangs up]

07:19.147 --> 07:20.148
[sighs]

07:28.698 --> 07:30.324
- [music stops]
- [siren blaring]

07:30.408 --> 07:32.535
[sighs] Fuck this shit.

07:34.996 --> 07:36.789
[sighs heavily]

07:39.959 --> 07:40.960
[Baek-jin] Hey.

07:46.424 --> 07:49.302
[Seong-je] What's up with you?
You came to pick me up?

07:51.512 --> 07:53.514
[dog barking in distance]

07:54.974 --> 07:56.476
[Seong-je inhales deeply]

08:06.194 --> 08:07.695
You hate it here, right?

08:09.197 --> 08:10.448
[Baek-jin] What do you mean?

08:13.659 --> 08:15.286
[Seong-je] This place is filthy.

08:16.704 --> 08:18.539
But you're a fucking neat freak.

08:19.290 --> 08:21.083
You always bring the assholes here.

08:21.876 --> 08:24.128
[laughs] This is where
you beat the shit out of them.

08:24.837 --> 08:27.673
Take a closer look.
There should be a ton of bloodstains.

08:33.387 --> 08:35.723
It smells like shit in here too.

08:35.806 --> 08:37.433
Fuck! [laughs]

08:38.267 --> 08:39.435
[inhales]

08:42.355 --> 08:43.439
[sighs]

08:44.398 --> 08:46.275
What did you have to tell the police?

08:47.193 --> 08:48.694
[suspenseful music playing]

08:50.112 --> 08:51.113
What?

08:54.200 --> 08:55.701
The burner bank account.

08:57.703 --> 08:59.539
Only you and I have access to it.

09:06.587 --> 09:07.755
[Seong-je scoffs]

09:14.887 --> 09:15.972
Just that…

09:17.932 --> 09:20.184
I tried to take money from kids in Eunjang

09:21.227 --> 09:22.687
and got into a fight.

09:22.770 --> 09:23.729
Are we good?

09:27.692 --> 09:28.901
[scoffs]

09:28.985 --> 09:31.737
You never fucking bothered
to ask me even once

09:33.614 --> 09:34.907
if I'm all right.

09:37.910 --> 09:39.120
Ah.

09:39.996 --> 09:40.997
That's right.

09:42.039 --> 09:43.040
[tuts]

09:43.124 --> 09:45.001
I was wondering why you brought me here.

09:48.170 --> 09:49.589
If I fucked up at all,

09:50.756 --> 09:53.217
if I told anything to the police,
you'd beat me to death?

09:53.301 --> 09:54.802
That's why you brought me here?

09:56.095 --> 09:57.096
Huh?

09:58.222 --> 09:59.223
So what?

10:00.683 --> 10:01.809
[Seong-je sighs]

10:01.892 --> 10:05.229
We might be fucking assholes,
but I thought we were on the same side.

10:09.275 --> 10:10.818
Don't come looking for me.

10:12.695 --> 10:13.946
I'm taking time off.

10:19.160 --> 10:21.120
[clears throat] Fuck this.

10:32.715 --> 10:34.717
[school bell rings]

10:48.189 --> 10:49.523
[horn honks]

10:49.607 --> 10:55.071
A-PLUS BOWLING CLUB

11:00.076 --> 11:01.535
[sighs]

11:08.584 --> 11:11.003
[man 1] The CEO wants to see you. Get in.

11:15.633 --> 11:16.967
I'll reach out to him.

11:18.010 --> 11:18.928
You can leave.

11:19.595 --> 11:21.263
[man 1] You little shit.

11:22.098 --> 11:23.683
[tense music playing]

11:24.600 --> 11:25.643
Hey, high school.

11:27.520 --> 11:29.355
Did you forget who we are?

11:31.899 --> 11:33.693
[car door opens and closes]

11:33.776 --> 11:34.819
[man 1] Motherfucker.

11:40.282 --> 11:42.284
Come here, fucker. You little shit!

11:49.375 --> 11:50.376
[grunts]

11:50.876 --> 11:52.169
[man 1] You motherfucker.

11:55.965 --> 11:57.258
Fuckin' asshole.

11:58.384 --> 11:59.593
[grunts]

12:01.512 --> 12:03.180
- [groans]
- [man 2] Hey, shithead.

12:08.936 --> 12:10.187
Fuck…

12:10.938 --> 12:12.022
[Baek-jin sighs]

12:18.988 --> 12:20.865
[man 1] What are you trying to pull?

12:22.616 --> 12:24.201
I said I'll reach out.

12:27.663 --> 12:28.706
[music stops]

12:31.250 --> 12:33.085
[Baku] You're craving thin samgyeopsal?

12:33.169 --> 12:35.212
Cool. Do you know
any good restaurants nearby?

12:35.296 --> 12:37.214
[Jun-tae] There's
an all-you-can-eat place.

12:37.298 --> 12:39.925
- [Baku] An all-you-can-eat?
- [Jun-tae] It's… it's around 13,000 won.

12:40.009 --> 12:43.012
[Baku] Hey, okay then. It's your treat
if you can't touch that thing.

12:43.637 --> 12:45.055
[Gotak] That was random. What thing?

12:45.139 --> 12:48.434
- You just said you could reach that.
- [Baku] Hey! Hey, Si-eun!

12:48.517 --> 12:49.518
[Jun-tae] Hi!

12:50.853 --> 12:51.854
[Baku] Yeon Si-eun!

12:52.730 --> 12:54.857
We were waiting forever for you!

12:54.940 --> 12:55.983
[sighs]

13:00.321 --> 13:02.448
- Why?
- What do you mean, why?

13:02.531 --> 13:04.408
We waited so you can
come with us, dumbass.

13:04.492 --> 13:06.786
- Stop making us wait! Let's go.
- [Gotak laughs]

13:06.869 --> 13:08.621
[Baku laughs] Come on, let's go.

13:08.704 --> 13:10.664
- [Jun-tae] Let's go, Si-eun-a.
- [Baku] Let's eat!

13:10.748 --> 13:12.082
[all laugh]

13:12.958 --> 13:14.710
- Hurry.
- Hurry up.

13:23.052 --> 13:24.678
- [cheerful music playing]
- [Baku chuckles]

13:25.262 --> 13:27.765
- [Jun-tae] Let's go!
- [Baku] Let's do this!

13:27.848 --> 13:31.727
Our dear, dear ice princess
has finally melted away.

13:31.811 --> 13:33.771
[Gotak, Jun-tae, and Baku laugh]

13:33.854 --> 13:35.105
[Si-eun] "Princess"?

13:35.189 --> 13:37.566
- Subtracting the eight will make--
- Hi, hello, my brothers.

13:37.650 --> 13:40.611
- What you up to? Studying?
- [Gotak] Stop bothering Si-eun, shithead.

13:40.694 --> 13:43.823
- You fucking asshole. You're the shithead.
- Stop bothering him. Si-eun's studying.

13:43.906 --> 13:46.408
- [Si-eun] Pay attention--
- Yeah, what is 2XL?

13:46.492 --> 13:48.160
Are you measuring sizes?

13:48.244 --> 13:49.578
What's that, a weapon box?

13:52.498 --> 13:55.125
Si-eun-chan, let's make
another snack bar run.

13:55.835 --> 13:58.003
- Hmm?
- It's only first period.

13:58.087 --> 14:01.131
Mmm, I know. But it's a special day today.

14:01.215 --> 14:05.261
- Our Gotak is treating everyone! [laughs]
- [Gotak] What the hell? I didn't say that.

14:05.344 --> 14:07.763
[Baku] You for sure
said you'd treat us. Jun, we…

14:07.847 --> 14:09.557
- Block Jun-tae!
- [Gotak] Under the net.

14:09.640 --> 14:11.058
Let's go. Over here. Over here.

14:11.141 --> 14:12.268
An under-over shot!

14:12.351 --> 14:13.894
- [Baku] Hey, shoot, shoot!
- [Jun-tae] Oh!

14:14.854 --> 14:17.189
- [Gotak] Oh! Yeah!
- [Jun-tae] Nice! Yeah!

14:18.858 --> 14:20.276
[Baku] Block him with your body.

14:20.359 --> 14:21.735
- Block! Shoot!
- [Jun-tae] Over here.

14:21.819 --> 14:23.737
- [Baku] Shoot. Shoot!
- [Gotak] Si-eun can't do it.

14:23.821 --> 14:25.239
[Baku] Let's go. Let's go!

14:26.115 --> 14:28.325
Hey, you see that?
You didn't have to block him.

14:28.409 --> 14:31.078
- I told you, bro!
- Nobody blocked. You threw an air ball!

14:35.124 --> 14:36.667
[Gotak] Aah.

14:36.750 --> 14:37.877
This is nice.

14:38.586 --> 14:39.753
Aah.

14:40.337 --> 14:42.715
Aah, things seem
almost too quiet around here.

14:45.301 --> 14:46.844
Those Union assholes,

14:47.887 --> 14:50.055
I don't think they would
back down this easily.

14:50.681 --> 14:54.018
[Baku] I already took care of everything,
so don't worry about it.

14:54.935 --> 14:57.688
It's peaceful. Enjoy it. [chuckles]

14:58.898 --> 15:00.524
Did you meet up with Na Baek-jin?

15:00.608 --> 15:02.526
Don't worry. I didn't, all right?

15:03.694 --> 15:06.030
Anyway, don't worry about that stuff.

15:06.113 --> 15:08.115
Union or anything like that. Yeah?

15:09.575 --> 15:12.411
Man! This is the best! [laughs]

15:15.039 --> 15:17.207
- [phone buzzes]
- [Baku] Huh?

15:21.462 --> 15:22.630
Hello?

15:22.713 --> 15:24.882
[man] Hello, this is
the Yeongdeungpo Police Station.

15:24.965 --> 15:26.634
Are you Park Jin-cheol-ssi's son?

15:30.721 --> 15:31.722
[Baku] Right.

15:32.765 --> 15:33.807
I understand.

15:37.603 --> 15:39.146
Hey, is something wrong?

15:39.229 --> 15:41.649
Huh? Oh, it was nothing.

15:43.484 --> 15:45.277
Something came up, so I better get going.

15:45.361 --> 15:46.528
- Oh, okay.
- Later.

15:48.322 --> 15:50.032
What is it? Where you going?

15:50.115 --> 15:51.992
You said it was nothing, you ass.

15:53.994 --> 15:56.038
- Hey, Park Hu-min!
- [Si-eun sighs]

15:57.081 --> 15:58.666
[tense music playing]

15:58.749 --> 16:02.503
[man] Well, last time, the kids denied it.
But they changed their statement.

16:02.586 --> 16:04.964
They're saying Park Jin-cheol-ssi
never asked for their ID,

16:05.047 --> 16:06.840
so they refused to sign the papers.

16:08.092 --> 16:10.219
Your father lost his temper, and…

16:11.762 --> 16:14.515
[sighs] He still shouldn't have hit
minors at a police station.

16:14.598 --> 16:16.433
SEOUL YEONGDEUNGPO POLICE STATION

16:17.309 --> 16:19.186
[snoring]

16:51.385 --> 16:52.678
NA BAEK-JIN

16:52.761 --> 16:55.139
The number you have dialed
is not available.

16:55.222 --> 16:56.765
Please leave a message…

16:56.849 --> 16:57.975
[phone buzzes]

16:59.977 --> 17:01.937
BAEK-JIN: JOIN THE UNION
THAT'S WHAT I WANT

17:02.021 --> 17:04.982
THEN I WON'T MESS WITH YOUR FATHER,
HIS BUSINESS, OR YOUR FRIENDS

17:06.734 --> 17:08.360
[breathing unsteadily]

17:08.444 --> 17:11.280
[boy 1] Bro, that old man had
a brutal fuckin' slap.

17:11.363 --> 17:12.948
Fuck, I thought I was gonna die.

17:14.158 --> 17:16.744
[boy 2] Cut the bullshit, idiot.
Stop overreacting.

17:17.494 --> 17:19.997
[boy 3] How much damage are
his chicken frying hands gonna do?

17:20.080 --> 17:21.665
Be for real! [laughs]

17:22.249 --> 17:24.001
[boy 2] Hey, was that Baku we just passed?

17:24.084 --> 17:27.421
[boy 3] Baku Fuck-you?
He can't do shit, bro. [laughs]

17:28.964 --> 17:30.966
[music intensifying]

17:50.569 --> 17:52.571
[phone buzzing]

17:52.654 --> 17:54.073
[music fades]

17:59.286 --> 18:00.871
- Hey.
- [boy] Baek-jin hyeong.

18:00.954 --> 18:03.123
I heard Park Hu-min
beat up our boys again.

18:04.249 --> 18:05.584
[sighs] That fucking asshole.

18:05.667 --> 18:08.378
Should our guys chase him down?
What should we do?

18:11.381 --> 18:12.382
Nothing.

18:13.092 --> 18:14.093
[boy] What?

18:14.968 --> 18:16.095
Just let him be.

18:17.805 --> 18:19.139
He's doing what's needed.

18:21.558 --> 18:22.768
[sighs]

18:26.563 --> 18:27.940
[bowling pins clatter]

18:31.026 --> 18:32.152
[man 1] Yeah!

18:39.409 --> 18:40.786
[man 2] Okay, I'll leave now.

18:44.957 --> 18:46.583
[boy 1] That fucking bastard.

18:47.960 --> 18:49.378
CEO Choi is here.

18:51.380 --> 18:53.507
[sighs] Those goddamn motherfuckers.

19:00.139 --> 19:01.348
[Choi] How've you been?

19:02.933 --> 19:04.351
[Baek-jin] What brings you here?

19:09.439 --> 19:10.774
What do you mean?

19:11.567 --> 19:12.526
[scoffs]

19:13.485 --> 19:16.905
Why would I need a reason to come
to a place of business that I own?

19:24.288 --> 19:25.330
Sit down.

19:37.092 --> 19:38.218
[sighs]

19:43.056 --> 19:44.224
[Choi sighs]

19:44.766 --> 19:46.268
Is everything all right?

19:48.061 --> 19:49.104
Yes.

19:52.608 --> 19:54.318
[glass smashing]

19:54.401 --> 19:58.447
If there aren't issues, why'd
the women in Juvenile Affairs call me?

19:58.530 --> 20:00.532
[tense music playing]

20:01.617 --> 20:02.910
Who was it again?

20:05.120 --> 20:07.372
Geum Seong-je? Goddamn it.

20:11.084 --> 20:16.423
You better do your job, Baek-jin-a,
before I have to step in. Got it?

20:21.887 --> 20:23.555
Don't make me come here again.

20:31.021 --> 20:32.522
[door alarm bleeps]

20:46.411 --> 20:47.829
Sit with me for a minute.

20:53.043 --> 20:55.462
You haven't been going
to your cram school lately.

20:56.713 --> 20:58.590
And why do you have a cut on your face?

20:59.174 --> 21:02.177
I'm worried about what you're doing
out there and also at school.

21:07.641 --> 21:09.226
Get ready to study abroad.

21:10.394 --> 21:12.354
Focusing on your studies
has been hard for you

21:12.437 --> 21:14.564
after that incident at your old school.

21:14.648 --> 21:17.109
This has been
a difficult decision for me to make.

21:19.695 --> 21:22.531
- It'll be better if we leave Korea.
- [Si-eun] I don't want to.

21:25.117 --> 21:27.953
[mother] Is it wrong for a mother
to worry about her son?

21:29.579 --> 21:30.664
[sighs]

21:35.961 --> 21:37.629
You're going to study abroad.

21:38.463 --> 21:39.589
That's final.

21:41.425 --> 21:42.509
[mother sighs]

21:44.261 --> 21:45.429
Why don't you…

21:47.556 --> 21:50.058
ignore me like you used to
and live your own life?

21:58.233 --> 21:59.401
I thought…

22:02.362 --> 22:03.947
[weeping]

22:04.823 --> 22:07.075
…that what happened at your old school…

22:10.829 --> 22:13.332
was all because of me somehow. [sniffles]

22:19.087 --> 22:21.214
Because I was a terrible mother.

22:22.299 --> 22:23.967
[breathing shakily]

22:24.885 --> 22:28.972
I can't let something like that
happen to my son again, can I? Huh?

22:31.475 --> 22:32.517
[gasps]

22:33.143 --> 22:36.271
Why is it so hard for you
to understand your own mother?

22:44.654 --> 22:46.656
[mother crying]

22:49.951 --> 22:51.953
[poignant music playing]

22:55.665 --> 22:56.917
[Si-eun] Su-ho-ya.

22:59.211 --> 23:00.379
If you were here,

23:03.090 --> 23:05.008
what advice would you give me?

23:08.678 --> 23:09.679
You…

23:11.431 --> 23:13.767
always knew exactly what to say.

23:15.769 --> 23:16.770
My mom…

23:18.814 --> 23:20.023
and you…

23:21.525 --> 23:23.235
everything that happens…

23:25.237 --> 23:27.197
it all seems like it's my fault.

23:32.536 --> 23:34.371
I have no idea

23:35.080 --> 23:36.206
what to do.

23:40.127 --> 23:42.879
Your mother said she'd handle
your academic records.

23:43.964 --> 23:45.090
Is that right?

23:46.091 --> 23:49.136
There are many international schools
that aren't considered an equivalent

23:49.219 --> 23:51.012
to a high-school degree in Korea.

23:51.763 --> 23:53.515
You'll have to study harder there.

23:54.307 --> 23:57.727
You'll get into a lot of trouble
if you hang out with the wrong kids again.

23:59.646 --> 24:01.064
- [boy 1] Did you hear?
- [boy 2] What?

24:01.148 --> 24:03.692
- [boy 1] Baku got in trouble again.
- [boy 2] Again?

24:03.775 --> 24:04.943
[boy 1] Some guy in the Union.

24:05.026 --> 24:07.946
Baku almost beat him to death
in front of a police station.

24:08.029 --> 24:11.116
[boy 2] Wow. He hasn't even been back
for that long since his last suspension.

24:11.199 --> 24:13.118
- [boy 1] I know.
- [boy 2] Maybe it's Baku's fault.

24:13.201 --> 24:14.369
Not the Union.

24:14.453 --> 24:16.913
[boy 1] What if the fucking Union
picks on us again?

24:16.997 --> 24:20.041
[boy 2] "No fighting," my ass.
He should stick to his own rules.

24:20.125 --> 24:22.419
[boy 1] Ugh, I loved how things
have been quiet for a while.

24:22.502 --> 24:24.004
Everything's gonna get crazy again.

24:24.087 --> 24:28.216
- EUNJANG HIGH, NO FIGHTING
- BAKU

24:28.300 --> 24:29.509
[Si-eun sighs]

24:38.310 --> 24:39.519
[music fades]

24:41.813 --> 24:43.106
[sighs]

24:45.692 --> 24:47.611
BAEK-JIN: JOIN THE UNION
THAT'S WHAT I WANT

24:47.694 --> 24:50.655
THEN I WON'T MESS WITH YOUR FATHER,
HIS BUSINESS, OR YOUR FRIENDS.

24:59.831 --> 25:01.625
[Jin-cheol] Are you skipping school again?

25:04.252 --> 25:05.754
I don't feel very good.

25:11.384 --> 25:12.677
[Jin-cheol] Be specific.

25:15.055 --> 25:16.139
[sighs]

25:17.599 --> 25:18.767
Just a cold.

25:22.854 --> 25:24.022
[sighs]

25:27.234 --> 25:29.945
[Jin-cheol] This little asshole.
Hey, brat.

25:30.779 --> 25:33.281
What'll happen when you get older? Huh?

25:35.784 --> 25:37.160
[breathing unsteadily]

25:37.244 --> 25:39.704
That's not really any
of your business, is it?

25:39.788 --> 25:42.374
What'd you say? You little bastard!

25:44.084 --> 25:46.169
Do what you want. Fine.

25:46.753 --> 25:48.338
Go ahead and keep on fighting.

25:48.922 --> 25:50.006
Quit school.

25:50.507 --> 25:52.384
Get a job and make money somewhere.

25:53.051 --> 25:54.302
Do you have any idea

25:55.136 --> 25:58.765
how much work and money it takes
to feed and house a brat like you?

25:59.266 --> 26:01.351
God, stop it, for fuck's sake!

26:03.687 --> 26:04.938
You little asshole.

26:08.775 --> 26:10.026
[sighs]

26:12.320 --> 26:15.490
[sighs] Fuck.
You have no idea who I'm doing this for.

26:24.374 --> 26:26.626
[phone buzzing]

26:39.514 --> 26:40.515
What?

26:43.351 --> 26:45.478
You've had more than enough time to think.

26:46.605 --> 26:49.524
Make your decision. I won't ask you twice.

26:52.360 --> 26:54.029
Your dad, your friends…

26:54.529 --> 26:56.197
[tense music playing]

26:57.365 --> 27:01.161
[Baek-jin] I'm the only one who can
give you what you want. No one else.

27:05.123 --> 27:06.916
You said you'd do whatever I want.

27:08.418 --> 27:10.086
I'll do whatever you want too.

27:24.768 --> 27:26.770
[music intensifying]

27:31.733 --> 27:33.735
[club music thumping]

27:36.321 --> 27:38.239
[cheering and laughter]

27:46.247 --> 27:47.624
[Baek-jin] It's an easy job.

27:48.792 --> 27:50.460
Just pricks from Seoknam High.

27:51.336 --> 27:52.629
Go warm up a little.

27:56.758 --> 27:58.760
[overlapping chatter]

27:59.969 --> 28:01.221
[boy 1] Hey, be quiet.

28:02.097 --> 28:03.640
Who's the one being loud, bro?

28:10.480 --> 28:12.816
ARE YOU THE SEOKNAM GORILLA?

28:12.899 --> 28:13.983
[chuckles]

28:14.484 --> 28:15.568
Who are you?

28:24.119 --> 28:25.370
Who the hell are you?

28:26.162 --> 28:29.040
- I'm sorry.
- What the fuck are you saying, you fucker?

28:29.124 --> 28:30.625
[chuckles]

28:33.586 --> 28:34.462
[laughing]

28:35.046 --> 28:37.549
Man, this guy, acting tough and shit?

28:37.632 --> 28:38.925
[groans]

28:40.719 --> 28:41.803
- [whimpers]
- Hey.

28:41.886 --> 28:43.179
Oh shit, man.

28:43.263 --> 28:44.973
- You motherfucker!
- [Gorilla gasps]

28:46.349 --> 28:48.059
[groaning]

28:55.942 --> 28:57.110
[Baku] Take it.

28:57.193 --> 28:59.237
NA BAEK-JIN

29:01.322 --> 29:03.116
[Gorilla] Hello? [whimpers]

29:04.117 --> 29:05.952
[Baek-jin] Seoknam is now
a part of the Union.

29:07.829 --> 29:10.165
- Come to my office.
- [groans]

29:10.248 --> 29:11.875
[Baek-jin] And we'll talk about it.

29:13.084 --> 29:14.294
Put the kid back on.

29:17.714 --> 29:19.132
It's… it's for you.

29:20.049 --> 29:21.301
[coughing]

29:30.226 --> 29:32.771
[Baku] Here. Get some pain patches.

29:50.288 --> 29:52.791
[doorbell rings]

29:57.504 --> 29:59.422
- [doorbell rings]
- [sighs]

30:08.431 --> 30:09.891
[Gotak] Is this the right place?

30:10.433 --> 30:12.769
[sighs] You think he went
to his cram school?

30:12.852 --> 30:14.229
- [Jun-tae] You think so?
- [bleep]

30:15.480 --> 30:17.148
How'd you know my address?

30:18.399 --> 30:19.984
Oh. Si…

30:21.027 --> 30:21.986
Si-eun-a.

30:22.695 --> 30:25.240
So our homeroom teacher
gave me your address--

30:25.323 --> 30:27.033
Hey! That's not what's important!

30:28.117 --> 30:30.161
Yeon Si-eun. Come on.

30:31.454 --> 30:33.540
- What?
- [Gotak] Come out of your house.

30:34.249 --> 30:35.291
Let's hang out.

30:36.167 --> 30:37.293
[gentle music playing]

30:37.377 --> 30:38.378
[Jun-tae] Ah!

30:38.878 --> 30:40.380
- Oh.
- [Gotak] That was too strong.

30:40.463 --> 30:42.048
- Switch. Switch.
- [Jun-tae] Go right here.

30:42.131 --> 30:44.175
[Gotak] Si-eun's next. Go for it.

30:47.178 --> 30:48.972
- [Jun-tae] Whoa!
- [Gotak] Ooh.

30:49.055 --> 30:52.350
- [Jun-tae] Awesome. Wow!
- [Gotak] Hey, Si-eun. You're not so bad.

30:52.433 --> 30:54.727
- [Jun-tae] One more time.
- [Gotak] Do that again.

30:57.063 --> 30:58.898
- [Jun-tae] Whoa!
- [Gotak] Whoa! What did you do?

30:58.982 --> 31:01.568
- Hey, you must've been practicing.
- [Jun-tae] Whoa, no way! My gosh.

31:04.195 --> 31:05.446
You're studying abroad?

31:06.531 --> 31:07.615
When are you leaving?

31:10.869 --> 31:12.495
I'm just thinking about it.

31:14.581 --> 31:15.790
I'm not sure.

31:18.751 --> 31:21.087
Aah! That'll be so great.

31:21.170 --> 31:23.298
I've never even been
on an airplane before.

31:27.302 --> 31:28.303
[sighs]

31:29.345 --> 31:31.556
We haven't really known
each other for long,

31:32.307 --> 31:33.725
but I feel like I have

31:35.310 --> 31:36.936
a lot to apologize for,

31:38.021 --> 31:39.856
and also a lot to be grateful about.

31:43.276 --> 31:44.652
This kinda sucks, man.

31:55.622 --> 31:57.832
What happened to Hu-min?

32:01.336 --> 32:03.087
I heard some weird rumors.

32:05.381 --> 32:08.635
Hey, I mean, this wasn't really
the first time he got into a fight.

32:09.218 --> 32:10.511
Don't worry, bruh.

32:10.595 --> 32:13.640
I'll knock sense into that dumbass
when he gets back. [tuts]

32:15.808 --> 32:18.478
Whatever. Let's play one more round.

32:23.483 --> 32:24.567
Hey, Jun-tae-ya.

32:25.234 --> 32:27.403
What the heck is wrong with your body,
man?

32:27.487 --> 32:29.197
- Agh! Do you remember?
- [Jun-tae] Yes.

32:29.280 --> 32:31.741
[Gotak] Better,
but you're still way too stiff.

32:32.533 --> 32:35.578
Just watch me. One, two, tap.

32:35.662 --> 32:37.205
- [basket rattles]
- [Jun-tae] Oh!

32:37.288 --> 32:38.623
- [Gotak] Am I good?
- [Jun-tae] Yes.

32:38.706 --> 32:40.291
[Gotak] You have to hit it from the top.

32:40.375 --> 32:42.251
- A light tap. Not too hard.
- [Jun-tae] Tap, tap.

32:42.335 --> 32:43.378
PARK HU-MIN

32:43.461 --> 32:45.088
- [ringing tone]
- [Gotak] One. Wait.

32:45.171 --> 32:46.714
[Gotak and Jun-tae] One, two, tap.

32:46.798 --> 32:48.883
- [basket clanks]
- [Gotak] Aah, almost, almost.

32:48.967 --> 32:51.094
- One more. You can do it. Good!
- [Jun-tae] One more.

32:51.177 --> 32:53.179
[phone buzzing]

33:04.565 --> 33:06.818
HIGH-AND-MIGHTY YEON SI-EUN

33:06.901 --> 33:08.152
[sighs]

33:12.657 --> 33:13.658
[exhales softly]

33:16.035 --> 33:17.120
[sighs]

33:20.206 --> 33:21.457
[Gotak] Shoot. Hey, the basket.

33:21.541 --> 33:22.750
- Score a point.
- [Jun-tae] Wait.

33:22.834 --> 33:25.378
- [Gotak] You forgot about the basket?
- [Si-eun] Where are you?

33:27.714 --> 33:29.132
[Jun-tae and Gotak] Whoa!

33:29.215 --> 33:31.467
- [Jun-tae laughing]
- [Gotak] Oh, nice, nice!

33:31.551 --> 33:34.345
- [Jun-tae] One more, one more!
- [Gotak] It's my turn. I'll shoot one.

33:34.429 --> 33:35.847
Doesn't matter.

33:35.930 --> 33:38.266
- [Gotak] All right. Come on.
- [Jun-tae] It's two to one.

33:38.349 --> 33:41.227
[Baku] Either way,
I won't cause you any trouble.

33:41.310 --> 33:43.187
[Gotak] Hey! If you jump like that…

33:43.271 --> 33:45.523
- Whoa! Whoa!
- [Jun-tae] I almost made one!

33:45.606 --> 33:47.358
[Si-eun] That's not what I meant.

33:51.237 --> 33:52.363
[sighs shakily]

33:54.490 --> 33:55.825
- [Gotak] Whoa!
- [Jun-tae] Nice!

33:55.908 --> 33:57.827
- I told you I could score.
- [Gotak] Nice job.

33:58.745 --> 33:59.954
Do it. Do it. Do it.

34:00.913 --> 34:03.332
- Whoa! Good one!
- [Jun-tae] Yeah! I did it!

34:03.416 --> 34:05.918
- [Gotak] Try that again. That's it!
- [Jun-tae] One more time.

34:06.002 --> 34:08.004
[melancholy music playing]

34:18.264 --> 34:19.390
[Baku sighs]

34:30.526 --> 34:33.613
[Baek-jin] We've all been
waiting for you. Good work.

34:39.160 --> 34:41.746
Welcome, Baku.

34:50.963 --> 34:52.965
[music intensifying]

34:56.094 --> 34:57.345
[music fades]

34:59.013 --> 35:00.348
[woman on PA] Please make sure

35:00.431 --> 35:03.518
you carry all your belongings
with you when you travel.

35:04.769 --> 35:07.188
Be sure not to leave
any luggage unattended.

35:07.730 --> 35:10.650
The boarding gates for Singapore
will be closing soon.

35:11.317 --> 35:14.821
If you are departing for Singapore,
please make your way…

35:14.904 --> 35:18.574
I put a ribbon on your suitcase,
so it should be easy for you to spot.

35:19.534 --> 35:20.660
I got you some lunch.

35:20.743 --> 35:26.124
Ladies and gentlemen, this is the final
boarding call for Sky Flight 9111…

35:26.207 --> 35:29.335
[sighs] Si-eun-a, try to stay positive.

35:29.418 --> 35:32.547
Okay? I'll wrap up my work
and be there, all right?

35:34.966 --> 35:35.967
And…

35:37.802 --> 35:38.845
thank you

35:39.720 --> 35:41.222
for understanding me.

35:41.973 --> 35:43.975
[phone buzzing]

35:51.065 --> 35:54.569
SEO JUN-TAE

36:00.741 --> 36:01.993
I'll be right back.

36:11.794 --> 36:14.213
Hey, Jun-tae-ya. What's goin' on?

36:15.590 --> 36:17.425
Hey, Si-eun, what are you doing?

36:20.303 --> 36:21.304
Nothing.

36:22.096 --> 36:23.222
Why'd you call?

36:26.225 --> 36:29.812
Well, I've been meaning to tell you, um…

36:32.148 --> 36:33.191
Hmm.

36:35.610 --> 36:36.944
Baku,

36:37.737 --> 36:38.738
Gotak…

36:41.574 --> 36:42.867
and I know

36:43.868 --> 36:47.163
that you visit your friend
at the hospital…

36:49.707 --> 36:52.835
and why he's in the hospital.

36:59.383 --> 37:00.718
I think…

37:07.516 --> 37:10.019
what happened wasn't because of you.

37:13.898 --> 37:15.524
So I wanted to tell you

37:16.359 --> 37:18.694
that it wasn't your fault.

37:24.575 --> 37:26.577
[emotional music playing]

37:34.168 --> 37:36.087
- [footsteps approaching]
- [sniffles]

37:36.837 --> 37:38.506
Si-eun-a, what?

37:39.006 --> 37:40.633
[gasps] What's wrong?

37:44.553 --> 37:45.763
I don't want to go.

37:47.098 --> 37:48.099
You what?

37:52.728 --> 37:54.021
[sniffles]

37:55.731 --> 37:57.024
My friends said

37:58.025 --> 37:59.568
that it wasn't my fault.

38:07.576 --> 38:09.662
[gentle song in Korean playing]

38:18.879 --> 38:20.881
[song continues]
